Hadoop 3 Web UI resources bundled in the Amoro fat JARs
======================================================

These components are copied from hadoop-client-api 3.4.3 under
webapps/static/, including compressed copies, CSS, themes and images.
MIT is selected where an MIT/GPL choice is offered. Original resource
headers remain in place. Full copyright and license notices follow.

